      "unclassified": "BioIntel Demo\nAntiviral reference page\nBioIntel demonstration record 9. The compound sofosbuvir was discussed with target NS5B in the context of hepatitis C. The example mutation is S282T. A demonstration IC50 measurement of 682 nM is shown for Hepatitis C virus. Synthetic reference labels: SYN-PAPER-0009 and SYN-DOI-NOT-REAL-0009. This content exists only to populate document search, extraction, entity recognition, history, comparison and evidence-bridge screens.\nCompound\nTarget\nAssay\nValue nM\nsofosbuvir\nNS5B\nIC50\n682\nNotice:\nDemonstration/reference content only; not experimental or clinical evidence."
